===Etymology===
From {{der|en|fr|cosmétique}}, from {{der|en|grc|κοσμητική||the art of dress and ornament}}, from {{m|grc|κοσμητικός}}, an adjective of {{m|grc|κοσμέω||to order, to arrange, to rule, to adorn, to equip, to dress, to embellish}}.

===Noun===
{{en-plural noun}}

# [[preparation|Preparation]]s [[applied]] [[externally]] to [[change]] or [[enhance]] the [[beauty]] of [[skin]], [[hair]], [[nail]]s, [[lip]]s, and [[eyes]].

===Noun===
{{en-noun|-}}

# The [[study]] of such products.

